nce he hoped for. As seasons turn, you spend time at the hospital, share a beer with villagers at the pub, visit the nearby forest and learn that people are not always honest with themselves or each other.\n\nThe world is lovingly illustrated, and the tone is heartfelt rather than action-driven, with darker secrets gradually coming to light. Single-player, with full controller support, and a fit for players who like character-led stories about work, pressure and finding your place."}}